	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 7th Level, choose one of the following features:</p><h2>Eye of the Owl</h2><p>You’ve become used to harsh winds, extreme temperature and whipping debris. You gain an expertise die to Constitution Saving Throws against being blinded, whether by physical (throwing debris, direct hits to the eye) or magical means, with spells or effects. (for a maximum of 1d10).</p><h2>Scorpion Wrangler</h2><p>Stingers, venom glands, and claws have no secrets for you: you gain an expertise die on Constitution Saving Throws against the poisoned condition (for a maximum of 1d10).</p><p>You also gain an expertise die on checks to escape the grapple of creatures with any type of claws.</p><h2>Tough as Stone</h2><p>The Desert is full of old and dangerous things, and you’ve weathered most of them; your spirit is a sturdy thing. You gain an expertise die to Constitution Saving Throws against being Petrified (for a maximum of 1d10).</p>",
